# Keep every tracked file LF in the repo and in the checkout. Without this, a Windows install of the
# plugin lands CRLF files, and the next `hermes plugins update` stashes the whole tree as "local
# changes" and refuses to re-apply them, which looks like a conflict and is only line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.wav binary
*.nam binary
